0 // One hub, one motor A, one free rocker and one physical33mm rubber band.
0 // Same neutral motor input can retain either left or right output state.
0 // Saved output angle -24.62822030007degrees; native input encoder zero.
0 // No custom joints, invisible stops, imposed output trajectories or ground anchors.
0 // 45610 hub battery is additional. Route integral motor cable behind the portal.
